<title>UK: British Biotech narrows Q3 loss.</title>
<headline>British Biotech narrows Q3 loss.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to January 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Loss per share(pence)  0.3		    vs 0.8</p>
<p> Loss after tax	   1.992		  vs 4.078</p>
<p> Loss before tax	  1.552		  vs 4.050</p>
<p> Operating loss	   4.382		  vs 4.452</p>
<p> Research and devt	9.248		  vs 7.194</p>
<p> Turnover		   8.533		  vs 4.500</p>
<p>				     - Nine months to January 31, 1997</p>
<p> Loss per share(pence)  2.9		    vs 3.1</p>
<p> Loss after tax	   18.095		 vs 15.062</p>
<p> Loss before tax	  17.638		 vs 15.034</p>
<p> Operating loss	   24.302		 vs 16.333</p>
<p> Research and devt	26.209		 vs 20.282</p>
<p> Turnover		   9.315		  vs 8.192</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the British biotechnology company is British Biotech Plc.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
